<title>AUSTRALIA: Morgan &amp; Banks year net profit A$9.87 mln.</title>
<headline>Morgan &amp; Banks year net profit A$9.87 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    16.73 vs 11.39</p>
<p>    Net					9.87 vs 6.76</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    14.00 vs 10.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Morgan and Banks Ltd is a personnel recruitment agency.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     26.5 vs 19.0</p>
<p>    Sales				  221.47 vs 143.06</p>
<p>    Other income			   0.48 vs 0.45</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    43.2 vs 30.0</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date July 11</p>
<p>Reg date June 27</p>
<p>    Tax					6.12 vs 4.20</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.26 vs 0.17</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   3.12 vs 2.15</p>
<p>    Minorities			     0.74 vs 0.44</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
